WEBVTT

00:11:00.072 --> 00:11:02.282
and I’ll proudly say, “Yes.”

00:11:02.282 --> 00:11:06.161
Because I realize I was the one
putting basketball in a box all along.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.123
Thank you so much for this opportunity.

00:11:09.164 --> 00:11:10.457
(Cheers)

00:11:10.499 --> 00:11:16.463
(Applause)